---
import DownloadButtons from '../../components/DownloadButtons.astro'
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Livestream Overlay Maker: TikTok &amp; Shopee Live overlays with safe zones | Oia"
  description="Design 1080×1920 livestream overlays for TikTok and Shopee Live: price cards, freeship badges, countdown frames, transparent PNG, safe-zone guides built in. Free &amp; open source."
  ogTitle="Livestream Overlay Maker: TikTok &amp; Shopee Live | Oia"
  ogDescription="1080×1920 transparent overlays with safe-zone guides for TikTok and Shopee Live."
  canonical="https://oia.solutions/use-cases/livestream-overlays/"
  base="../../"
  links={[{ href: '../../#workflow', label: 'How it works' }, { href: '../../prompts/', label: 'Prompt library' }, { href: '../../templates/', label: 'Templates' }]}
  footerLinks={[{ href: '../../', label: 'Home' }, { href: '../../prompts/', label: 'Prompt library' }, { href: '../../templates/', label: 'Templates' }, { href: '../flash-sale-banners/', label: 'Flash-sale banners' }, { href: '../presentations/', label: 'Presentations' }]}
>
<header class="pageHero">
  <p class="kicker">Use case, live commerce</p>
  <h1>Overlays that dodge the UI.<br>Prices that change mid-stream.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Flash-sale price cards, freeship badges, countdown frames, 1080×1920 transparent PNG with TikTok and Shopee Live safe-zone guides built into the editor. When the price drops live, repaint the card with one prompt.</p>
  <DownloadButtons rowClass="ctaRow" anchorId="download" installHref="../../install/" ghost={{ href: '../../prompts/', label: 'Copy the prompts' }} />
</header>

<main class="pageMain">
  <p class="catNote">Open Templates in the desktop editor and choose a livestream overlay to preview the transparent canvas and safe-zone guides.</p>

  <div class="ucGrid">
    <div>
      <h2 class="catH" style="margin-top:8px">The overlay loop</h2>
      <div class="stepsList">
        <div><span class="n">01: PICK</span><h3>Overlay preset or template</h3><p>Livestream overlay 1080×1920 transparent, or start from Flash sale price / Freeship badge / Countdown frame.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">02: GUIDE</span><h3>Safe zones on</h3><p>TikTok and Shopee Live guides mark where the platform's buttons and comments land: keep your card out of the hatched bands.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">03: REPRICE</span><h3>One prompt, same style</h3><p>Price drop mid-stream? Ask for the new number: the repaint keeps the glossy card treatment, previewed before it replaces the layer.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">04: EXPORT</span><h3>Transparent PNG</h3><p>Guides never reach the exported bytes: a clean alpha PNG for OBS or your streaming tool.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="catH" style="margin-top:8px">Why it works</h2>
      <div class="promptGrid">
        <div class="promptCard"><h3>Community-measured zones</h3><p class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">TikTok &amp; Shopee Live layouts, honest label: not an official spec, measured where the UI actually lands.</p></div>
        <div class="promptCard"><h3>Text that stays editable</h3><p class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Template prices are native text layers: swap $8.90 → $5.90 for free, no regeneration.</p></div>
        <div class="promptCard"><h3>3:4 refused, honestly</h3><p class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Ask for a wrong-ratio overlay and Oia tells you instead of silently shipping a stretched card.</p></div>
        <div class="promptCard"><h3>Live covers too</h3><p class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Shopee live cover 500×500 and TikTok cover 1080×1920 presets ship alongside the overlay.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq" style="margin-top:26px">
        <details><summary>What size is a TikTok livestream overlay?</summary><p>1080×1920 (9:16). Oia ships the preset with a transparent background and community-measured safe-zone guides so your card never hides behind TikTok's buttons and comments.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do the overlays export with transparency?</summary><p>Yes, PNG with alpha at 1080×1920, straight into OBS. The guides stay in the editor and never reach the exported bytes.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
</Page>
